<script>
	let completedLessons = $state(2);

	function markLessonComplete() {
		completedLessons += 1;
	}
</script>

This post now uses `.svx`, which means we can mix markdown with Svelte components and logic.

## Interactive block

<button on:click={markLessonComplete}>Complete a lesson</button>
<p><strong>Completed lessons:</strong> {completedLessons}</p>

